Looking to avoid common AV rental mistakes in Malaga? Most of them are not about broken equipment: they are about assuming a package includes something it doesn't, until the day of the event.

Malaga Event Gear delivers, installs and tests every package across Malaga and the wider Costa del Sol.

Contact us today to discuss your event.

## Brief Overview

---

Malaga Event Gear helps you avoid the common AV rental mistakes that come from assuming a package includes a technician, a projector or a specific microphone when it doesn't. Backed by experience going back to 1996, we deliver, install and test the equipment, so your only job is to book the right package.

Contact us today to discuss your event.

## Key Highlights

---

Most AV rental mistakes come from assuming a package includes something it doesn't.

-   Only the Wedding Pack and MICE Pack include a technician standard; the Basic MICE Pack offers one as a paid add on.

-   Not every package includes a projector or screen: the Eco Pack's is an optional add on, and the Wedding Pack has none at all.

-   Guest capacity is fixed per package, from 40 on the Basic MICE Pack up to 120 on the MICE Pack.

## 10 Common Mistakes to Avoid

1.  **Assuming every package includes a technician.** Only the [Wedding Pack](/packages/wedding/) and [MICE Pack](/packages/mice/) include one standard. The [Basic MICE Pack](/packages/basic-mice/) offers it only as a paid add on, at 240 euros per day.
2.  **Assuming a package includes a projector or screen it doesn't.** The [Eco Pack](/packages/eco/) has no screen standard, it is a 50 euro optional add on. The [Wedding Pack](/packages/wedding/) has no projector or screen at all.
3.  **Picking a package by name instead of by guest count.** Real capacity limits: the [Basic MICE Pack](/packages/basic-mice/) covers up to 40 guests, the [Eco Pack](/packages/eco/) up to 50, the [Wedding Pack](/packages/wedding/) up to 80, and the [MICE Pack](/packages/mice/) up to 120.
4.  **Assuming staging or a lectern is included in a corporate package.** On the [MICE Pack](/packages/mice/), both are separate add ons: staging at 35 euros per square meter, a premium lectern at 50 euros.
5.  **Not confirming which microphone the package includes.** The [Basic MICE Pack](/packages/basic-mice/) includes a gooseneck microphone for a podium or lectern. The [Product Presentation Pack](/packages/product-presentation/) includes a wireless handheld microphone. The [MICE Pack](/packages/mice/) includes both.

<InlineCTA />

6.  **Budgeting off the headline price alone.** Every price on our [packages page](/packages/) is ex VAT, with 21 percent Spanish VAT added at checkout, and add ons like a projector, extra technician hours, a lectern or staging are billed separately.
7.  **Assuming you need to arrange pickup or setup yourself.** Every package is delivered, installed and tested by our crew, then collected again after your event. This is not a self-collect model.
8.  **Booking right at a package's guest cap with no margin.** If your guest list can still grow, book the next package up rather than the one that only just covers your current count.
9.  **Assuming laptop adapters are included on every package.** The [Product Presentation Pack](/packages/product-presentation/) includes HDMI and USB-C adapters plus audio interfaces at no extra cost. Confirm this for other packages rather than assuming it applies everywhere.
10. **Assuming sound scale is interchangeable across packages.** The [Eco Pack](/packages/eco/)'s sound system is sized for up to 50 guests in a private setting. A larger reception needs the [Wedding Pack](/packages/wedding/)'s PA system instead.

