## FAQs

### What is the most common mistake people make when renting AV equipment?

Assuming a package includes something it doesn't, most often a technician or a projector. Check [10 Common Mistakes to Avoid](#10-common-mistakes-to-avoid) above before you book.

### Does my AV rental package come with a technician?

It depends on the package. The [Wedding Pack](/packages/wedding/) and [MICE Pack](/packages/mice/) include one standard. The [Basic MICE Pack](/packages/basic-mice/) offers one as a paid add on, at 240 euros per day.

### Do I need to test the equipment before the event starts?

Our crew tests every setup on delivery, before your event starts. You never receive untested equipment.

### Do I need to arrange pickup or setup myself?

No. Every package is delivered, installed and tested by our crew, then collected again afterward. This is not a self-collect model.

### What size package do I actually need?

It depends on your guest count: up to 40 for the Basic MICE Pack, 50 for the Eco Pack, 80 for the Wedding Pack, and 120 for the MICE Pack. If your list can still grow, book the next size up.

### How much does AV rental actually cost once VAT and extras are included?

Every price on our [packages page](/packages/) is ex VAT, with 21 percent Spanish VAT added at checkout. Add ons like a projector, extra technician hours, a lectern or staging are billed separately from the base price.

### How far in advance should I book AV equipment?

Book at least 24 hours in advance to guarantee availability. Our services are available in Malaga and extend to Granada for rentals over 400 euros.
